# Plus Practice (`projects/addition-flashcards/`)

Kids addition flash-card game.

## Rules

- One addend from the selected set; the other is random **1–10**
- Groups: All, 1–5, 6–10 (saved in localStorage)
- Lesson log by **first answer**; review missed cards after practice
- Four multiple-choice answers per card
- Each addend shows matching little apples to count (optional)
- Stats: streak, first-right, first-wrong

## Local URL

http://localhost:3000/projects/addition-flashcards/
